Vendored subset of zlib 1.3.1 (https://zlib.net, zlib license — see
LICENSE): inflate only, used for zip (deflate) and gzip in M8.
Fetched from the v1.3.1 tag of https://github.com/madler/zlib.
Unmodified sources; compiled with the project default flags but
exempted from the -W warning set (see Makefile).
